{"id":10046,"name":"scizor-mega","speciesId":212,"dex":212,"form":"mega","generation":2,"types":["bug","steel"],"stats":{"hp":70,"attack":150,"defense":140,"special-attack":65,"special-defense":100,"speed":75},"abilities":[{"name":"technician","hidden":false}],"height":20,"weight":1250,"baseExp":210,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/10046.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/10046.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/10046.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/10046.ogg","genus":"Pincer Pokémon","genusPt":"Pokémon pinça","flavor":[{"version":"pearl","text":"It has a steel-hard body. It intimidates foes by upraising its eye-patterned pincers."},{"version":"gold","text":"It swings its eye- patterned pincers up to scare its foes. This makes it look like it has three heads."},{"version":"silver","text":"Its wings are not used for flying. They are flapped at high speed to adjust its body temperature."},{"version":"crystal","text":"This POKéMON's pincers, which contain steel, can crush any hard object it gets a hold of into bits."},{"version":"ruby","text":"SCIZOR has a body with the hardness of steel. It is not easily fazed by ordinary sorts of attacks. This POKéMON flaps its wings to regulate its body temperature."},{"version":"emerald","text":"A SCIZOR has a body with the hardness of steel. It is not easily fazed by ordinary sorts of attacks. It flaps its wings to regulate its body temperature."},{"version":"leafgreen","text":"It swings its eye-patterned pincers up to scare its foes. This makes it look like it has three heads."},{"version":"platinum","text":"It raises its pincers with eyelike markings for intimidation. It also swings them down dangerously."},{"version":"x","text":"This Pokémon’s pincers, which contain steel, can crush any hard object it gets ahold of into bits."},{"version":"omega-ruby","text":"Scizor has a body with the hardness of steel. It is not easily fazed by ordinary sorts of attacks. This Pokémon flaps its wings to regulate its body temperature."},{"version":"sun","text":"It uses its wings to adjust its body temperature. Otherwise, its metal body would become too hot and melt in the heat of battle."},{"version":"moon","text":"Once it has identified an enemy, this Pokémon smashes it mercilessly with pincers hard as steel."},{"version":"ultra-sun","text":"Its body is like steel. Its tough, heavy pincers are more suited to smashing enemies than grabbing them."},{"version":"ultra-moon","text":"Once it has identified something as an enemy, it will continue beating them with its steel-hard pincers until there’s nothing left but scraps."},{"version":"sword","text":"Bulky pincers account for one third of Scizor’s body weight. A single swing of one of these pincers will crush a boulder completely."},{"version":"shield","text":"Though its body is slim, Scizor has tremendous attacking power. Even Scizor’s muscles are made of metal."},{"version":"legends-arceus","text":"Evolved by way of a curious item. The shell covering its body has been shown to be stronger than forged steel."}],"flavorPt":"Evoluiu por meio de um item curioso. A carcaça que cobre seu corpo demonstrou ser mais forte que o aço forjado.","genderRate":4,"captureRate":25,"eggGroups":["bug"],"isLegendary":false,"isMythical":false,"evolution":{"species":"scyther","speciesId":123,"evolvesTo":[{"conditions":["Troca, Segurando Metal Coat"],"species":"scizor","speciesId":212,"evolvesTo":[]},{"conditions":["Usar Black Augurite"],"species":"kleavor","speciesId":900,"evolvesTo":[]}]},"varieties":[{"id":212,"name":"scizor","form":"normal","sprite":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/212.png"},{"id":10046,"name":"scizor-mega","form":"mega","sprite"